# Amazon Ads history charts

History charts opened from a dot on `/amazon-ads/all` (CPC Avg, LT CVR, LT ACOS, and any later metric history) use the Active Channel chart, not a plain Highcharts line.

Match `#adBreakdownChartModal` in `resources/views/channels/all-marketplace-master.blade.php`:

- Full-width modal, info header, Chart.js line
- Range select: 7, 30 (default), 31, 32, 35, 60, 90, Lifetime
- Gray line, green when the value improves and red when it worsens (CPC down is green)
- Rotated value labels, dashed median line
- Right panel: Highest, Median, Lowest
- Title form: `{name} - {metric} (Rolling {range})`
